  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/IG_UI.json|IGUI_perks_Lockpicking_Description": "Skill at manipulating pin-tumbler locks with improvised tools. Higher levels widen the pick's sweet spot, reduce wear on bobby pins, and grant access to tougher locks.",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/ItemName.json|Base.BobbyPin": "Bobby Pin",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/ItemName.json|Base.BoneBobbyPin": "Bone Pick",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/ItemName.json|Base.BookLockpicking1": "Lockpicking I: \"Springing the Basics\"",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/ItemName.json|Base.BookLockpicking2": "Lockpicking II: \"Feeling the Pins\"",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/ItemName.json|Base.BookLockpicking3": "Lockpicking III: \"Torque and Tension\"",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/ItemName.json|Base.BookLockpicking4": "Lockpicking IV: \"High-Security Headaches\"",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/ItemName.json|Base.BookLockpicking5": "Lockpicking V: \"The Locksport Masterclass\"",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/ItemName.json|Base.Lockpick": "Lockpick",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/ItemName.json|Base.LockpickingMag": "Locksport Monthly",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recipes.json|MakeBoneBobbyPin": "Carve Bone Pick",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recipes.json|MakeLockpicks": "Make Lockpicks",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t1_l01": "Hi folks! Ever slammed the door with your keys sitting right there on the counter?",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t1_l02": "Before you call a locksmith at forty dollars an hour, let's talk about how a lock actually works.",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t1_l03": "A lock is just five little spring-loaded pins. Lift each one to the shear line and the whole cylinder turns free.",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t1_l04": "My cousin Dale kicks his door in. Don't be like Dale. Dale owns three broken doors.",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t1_l05": "All you need is two bits of stiff wire. A bobby pin from the missus works a treat.",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t1_l06": "Steady tension with the wrench, feel for the stiff pin, and ease it up... there's the click.",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t1_l07": "Now don't go practicing on the neighbor's house. Officer Reilly watches this channel too.",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t1_l08": "If the pin snaps off in the keyway, well, NOW you call the locksmith. Sorry, Earl.",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t1_l09": "One pin at a time, front to back. Rushing it just resets the whole lock. Patience, friend.",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t1_l10": "And keep a spare key under a rock like a normal person, would you?",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t1_l11": "Next week: what to do when your car keys are IN the car. Bring a wire hanger!",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t1_name": "Home VHS: Locked Out Again?!",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t1_sub": "A homeowner's guide to jammed and stubborn locks. Taped off public access.",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t1_title": "Locked Out Again?!",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t2_l01": "Okay, it's rolling. October meeting of the Kentucky Locksport Club, all six of us present.",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t2_l02": "First order of business: Denise brought her famous burgoo, get it while it's hot.",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t2_l03": "Tonight's demo: the raking technique. Fast and sloppy - scrub the pins while you feather the tension.",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t2_l04": "Raking beats a cheap lock in seconds, but a good lock with security pins will spit your rake right out.",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t2_l05": "Remember: light tension. If your wrench is white-knuckled, you're binding every pin at once.",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t2_l06": "Bill, point the camera at the LOCK, not at Denise's burgoo. Thank you, Bill.",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t2_l07": "Gary defeated the padlock off the clubhouse fridge in eleven seconds. New club record.",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t2_l08": "For the heavy stuff - your deadbolts, your security doors - it's single pin picking or nothing, folks.",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t2_l09": "Motion to buy Gary a harder padlock passes six to zero.",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t2_l10": "Dues are due, and remember the club creed: we pick locks we OWN, people.",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t2_l11": "Same time next month. Somebody tell Gary the fridge lock is ceremonial now. Meeting adjourned.",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t2_name": "Home VHS: Kentucky Locksport Club",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t2_sub": "Camcorder recording of a hobbyist lockpicking club meet in Louisville.",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Recorded_Media.json|RM_LKP_t2_title": "Kentucky Locksport Club - October Meeting",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_Lockpicking": "Lockpicking",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LockpickingXpMultiplier": "XP Multiplier - Lockpicking",
  "translate_en|mods/Lockpicking/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_LockpickingXpMultiplier_tooltip": "Multiplies all Lockpicking XP gains. Matches the vanilla per-skill XP multiplier options."
